---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { navItems } from "../../../data/i18n";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Environmental Science - Víctor Cazorla Fernández"
  description="Environmental science, judicial expertise and teaching: marine ecology research, university quality evaluation and professional practice in environmental management."
  image="/images/og/cienciasambientales.svg"
  imageAlt="Environmental Science — Víctor Cazorla Fernández"
  lang="en"
  navItems={navItems.en}
>
  <main class="container narrow">

    <h1>Environmental Science | Certified Environmental Scientist</h1>

    <section class="career">
      <h2>Professional journey</h2>
      <div class="career-grid">
        <article class="career-card">
          <div class="career-card__header">
            <img class="career-card__logo" src="/logos/gencat.jpeg" alt="Generalitat de Catalunya logo" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="career-card__company">
              <strong>Generalitat de Catalunya</strong>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="career-card__role">
            <span class="career-card__title">Environmental Expert Witness</span>
            <span class="career-card__specialty">Department of Justice and Democratic Quality</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="career-card">
          <div class="career-card__header">
            <img class="career-card__logo" src="/logos/aqua.jpeg" alt="AQUA logo" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="career-card__company">
              <strong>Agency for University Quality of Andorra</strong>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="career-card__role">
            <span class="career-card__title">Member of the Register of Expert Persons</span>
            <span class="career-card__specialty">External evaluation of university science programmes</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="career-card">
          <div class="career-card__header">
            <img class="career-card__logo" src="/logos/coamb.jpeg" alt="COAMB logo" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="career-card__company">
              <strong>Official Association of Environmental Scientists of Catalonia</strong>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="career-card__role">
            <span class="career-card__title">Collaborating lecturer</span>
            <span class="career-card__specialty">Training and evaluation of environmental professionals</span>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="editorial-text">
      <h2 class="section-subtitle">
        Professional practice and commitment to the public sphere
      </h2>
    </section>

    <section class="editorial-text subtle">
      <h3 class="section-subtitle">Collaborating Lecturer</h3>

      <p>
        I believe that the incorporation of environmental professionals into the public service requires more than technical knowledge; it must include an understanding of the regulatory, institutional, and social frameworks in which decisions are made that impact territory, ecosystems, and citizens, as well as an acceptance of the responsibility inherent to exercising public power legitimized by social trust.
      </p>

      <p>
        Therefore, preparing environmental scientists for access to senior public administration roles should not be seen merely as technical training but as an opportunity to consolidate judgment, service vocation, and a sense of responsibility.
      </p>
      <p>
        In this sense, the responsibility of the instructor in designing coherent training content aligned with autonomous, national, and European legal frameworks responds to the need to contribute to a responsible exercise of public power oriented toward the general interest.
      </p>

      <div
        style="
          margin-top: 2rem;
          padding: 0.9rem 1.1rem;
          max-width: 520px;
          display: flex;
          align-items: center;
          gap: 1.2rem;
          border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
          border-radius: 12px;
          background: linear-gradient(
            180deg,
            rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03),
            rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.01)
          );
        "
      >
        <a
          href="https://www.coamb.cat/formacio/lescola-de-formacio-del-coamb/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          style="
            display: block;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            padding: 0.5rem 0.7rem;
            background: var(--chip-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--chip-border);
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: var(--chip-shadow);
          "
        >
          <img
            src="/img/banner-coamb.jpg"
            alt="Training school of the Official Association of Environmental Scientists of Catalonia"
            width="300"
            height="212"
            style="
              width: 120px;
              height: auto;
              max-height: 60px;
              object-fit: contain;
              display: block;
            "
          />
        </a>

        <p
          style="
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            line-height: 1.4;
            opacity: 0.8;
          "
        >
          Training school of the Official Association of Environmental Scientists of Catalonia
        </p>
      </div>

      <h3
        class="section-subtitle"
        style="margin-top: 3.4rem;"
      >
        Environmental Expert Witness
      </h3>

      <p>
        Contrary to common belief, the issue is not what is evaluated, but under what conditions truth can be asserted when it produces legal and social effects; the expert witness intervenes where the conflict requires a stabilization of meaning, where knowledge is expected to transform uncertainty into a stable point, while knowing that this knowledge can act as premature closure, as a technical pretext or, in certain uses, as a substitute for judicial decision-making when the report ceases to guide the decision and instead functions as a replacement. What is then demanded of truth in that context? Not a conclusive assertion, but a strict relationship with what can be sustained, with its limits and with the inherent consequences of stating it. The problem is not the absence of an answer, but the constant pressure to say more than the framework of knowledge itself allows.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="editorial-text">
      <h2 class="section-subtitle">Scientific Research</h2>

      <p>
        I maintain several active research lines in the field of biological and environmental sciences such as marine ecology, microbiology, and population dynamics of invasive exotic species.
      </p>

      <h3 style="margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600;">Published articles</h3>

      <div style="margin-bottom: 1.8rem; padding: 1rem; border-left: 3px solid var(--accent); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);">
        <p style="margin: 0 0 0.4rem 0; line-height: 1.6;">
          <strong>Biomass dynamics of <em>Caulerpa prolifera</em> under warming, acidification and eutrophication in a mesocosm system.</strong>
        </p>
        <p style="margin: 0; font-style: italic; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75); font-size: 0.95rem;">
          Cazorla Fernández, V. (in press). <em>Ecologia Mediterranea</em>, 52(1).
        </p>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-bottom: 1.8rem; padding: 1rem; border-left: 3px solid var(--accent); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);">
        <p style="margin: 0 0 0.4rem 0; line-height: 1.6;">
          <strong>Interannual persistence of alien freshwater chelonians in a periurban agricultural pond in Vallès Occidental (NE Iberian Peninsula).</strong>
        </p>
        <p style="margin: 0; font-style: italic; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75); font-size: 0.95rem;">
          Cazorla Fernández, V. (in press). <em>Bulletin of the Spanish Herpetological Association</em>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div
        style="
          margin-top: 2rem;
          padding: 1.4rem 1.6rem;
          max-width: 680px;
          border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
          border-radius: 14px;
          background: linear-gradient(
            180deg,
            rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04),
            rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.015)
          );
          display: flex;
          flex-direction: column;
          gap: 1.2rem;
        "
      >
        <div>
          <a
            href="https://orcid.org/0009-0009-7976-9691"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            style="
              color: var(--accent);
              text-decoration: none;
              font-weight: 500;
            "
          >
            ORCID: 0009-0009-7976-9691
          </a>
          <p style="margin: 0.4rem 0 0 0; font-size: 0.9rem; opacity: 0.8;">
            Unique researcher identifier in global scientific repositories
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="editorial-text">

      <h2 class="section-subtitle">External evaluation and participation in expert pools</h2>

      <p>
        Since March 2026 I have been a member of the <strong>Pool of Expert Persons</strong> of
        <strong>AQUA (Agency for University Quality, Andorra)</strong> in the field of Environmental Science and Earth Sciences. My role involves
        external evaluation of higher education programmes, contributing to quality assurance processes and the preparation of evaluation reports.
      </p>

      <p>
        This activity complements my research and expert witness work, providing an applied and regulatory perspective on the educational quality standards for programmes related to the environment and territory.
      </p>

    </section>

    <section
      style="
        margin-top: 5rem;
        padding-top: 2.4rem;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
      "
    >
      <p
        style="
          font-size: 0.9rem;
          line-height: 1.6;
          color: var(--text-muted);
          max-width: 640px;
        "
      >
        Expert witness practice and professional environmental services are carried out independently through
        <a
          href="https://www.peritoambiental.es"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          style="
            color: var(--accent);
            text-decoration: none;
            white-space: nowrap;
          "
        >
          peritoambiental.es
        </a>,
        a dedicated space focused on technical intervention, expert report preparation, and specialized advisory services in administrative and judicial contexts.
      </p>
    </section>

    <style>
      .career {
        margin-top: 2.5rem;
      }

      .career h2 {
        margin: 0 0 1rem;
      }

      .career-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
        gap: 1.2rem;
        margin-top: 1.2rem;
      }

      .career-card {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 1rem;
        min-height: 100%;
        padding: 1.25rem;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
        border-radius: 16px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
        box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      }

      .career-card__header {
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 0.9rem;
        padding-bottom: 0.8rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      }

      .career-card__logo {
        width: 64px;
        height: 64px;
        object-fit: contain;
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 0.5rem;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }

      .career-card__company {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0.2rem;
        justify-content: center;
      }

      .career-card__company strong {
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        line-height: 1.35;
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      .career-card__role {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0.35rem;
        justify-content: center;
      }

      .career-card__title {
        font-size: 1.04rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        line-height: 1.4;
      }

      .career-card__specialty {
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        opacity: 0.8;
        line-height: 1.5;
        letter-spacing: 0.01em;
      }
    </style>

  </main>
</BaseLayout>
